WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.940
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:15.210 --> 00:17.560
[Fifty years ago]

3
00:19.650 --> 00:21.010
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Madam Zhang, Wife of Li]

4
00:21.290 --> 00:23.780
[Li Shan]

5
00:24.440 --> 00:26.600
I hired you to read our Four Pillars of Destiny.

6
00:26.600 --> 00:28.800
You said my wife and I would be together for a long time,

7
00:26.780 --> 00:28.290
[Teenage Sect Master Zhou Xingsi]

8
00:28.460 --> 00:30.110
[Former Sect Master Shen Yunhe]

9
00:28.960 --> 00:30.800
and that it was a match made in heaven.

10
00:30.800 --> 00:32.520
Yet not even a year later...

11
00:33.450 --> 00:35.380
You still claim you're not a fraud?

12
00:37.350 --> 00:38.960
I paid you so much money.

13
00:38.960 --> 00:40.710
You must pay me back double

14
00:40.750 --> 00:41.960
and kneel before my late wife's spirit tablet

15
00:41.960 --> 00:43.110
for 3 days.

16
00:43.140 --> 00:43.820
Kneel!

17
00:43.880 --> 00:44.750
Kneel before Madam!

18
00:44.750 --> 00:45.600
Kneel!

19
00:45.900 --> 00:46.820
Men!

20
00:46.960 --> 00:48.750
Pull out their tongues!

21
00:48.790 --> 00:50.720
Let's see if they dare to scam anyone again!

22
00:50.720 --> 00:51.490
Do it!

23
00:59.430 --> 01:00.150
Honey.

24
01:00.600 --> 01:01.600
Honey!

25
01:02.000 --> 01:02.960
Honey!

26
01:03.660 --> 01:06.880
When I read the Four Pillars of Destiny of you and your wife back then,

27
01:06.880 --> 01:08.490
I did say that

28
01:08.520 --> 01:10.190
once you were married,

29
01:10.230 --> 01:12.510
your family would prosper.

30
01:16.070 --> 01:17.000
But I...

31
01:18.050 --> 01:20.210
never said both of you

32
01:21.340 --> 01:22.950
had to be alive.

33
01:25.640 --> 01:28.620
You and your wife are a rare case of Yin and Yang clashing

34
01:28.620 --> 01:30.620
yet generating each other,

35
01:30.640 --> 01:32.270
with a hidden heavenly secret.

36
01:32.270 --> 01:34.470
When she was alive, it was a doomed bond,

37
01:34.680 --> 01:36.009
but now that she's dead,

38
01:36.640 --> 01:37.870
it has become

39
01:38.680 --> 01:39.630
a good match.

40
01:45.789 --> 01:47.150
She's already dead.

41
01:47.509 --> 01:49.240
How can it still be a good match?

42
01:50.240 --> 01:52.810
Your wife's fate blueprint is an unusual one.

43
01:52.830 --> 01:56.190
As long as you keep her soul trapped in your household,

44
01:56.220 --> 01:58.910
it will turn into a twin lotus

45
01:59.080 --> 02:02.240
and send your family soaring.

46
02:02.660 --> 02:03.910
Your descendants

47
02:05.630 --> 02:07.480
will enjoy endless

48
02:08.110 --> 02:10.120
wealth and glory.

49
02:20.280 --> 02:21.030
Mentor,

50
02:21.640 --> 02:24.690
we made it through this crisis just like that?

51
02:32.710 --> 02:34.430
Pull out their tongues!

52
02:34.430 --> 02:36.829
Let's see if they dare to scam anyone again!

53
02:37.430 --> 02:39.270
In our Tianxiang Sect,

54
02:39.290 --> 02:42.520
there is a scam called the "double-sided scam,"

55
02:42.550 --> 02:46.550
which involves a surface scheme and a hidden one.

56
02:46.630 --> 02:48.540
A scam has two sides,

57
02:48.750 --> 02:50.820
and so do people.

58
02:50.820 --> 02:52.140
You must remember,

59
02:52.260 --> 02:54.420
what people believe

60
02:54.630 --> 02:56.790
isn't a matter of truth or falsehood,

61
02:57.230 --> 03:00.190
but of which way the scale in their own hearts

62
03:00.310 --> 03:02.140
tips.

63
03:02.700 --> 03:05.910
This scam will run for decades,

64
03:06.180 --> 03:09.180
and one day it will become

65
03:09.820 --> 03:11.140
your scam.

66
04:52.180 --> 04:56.100
[A Prophet]

67
04:56.860 --> 04:59.110
[Episode 20]

68
05:05.870 --> 05:07.980
Jiang Feiyan saved Li Ling,

69
05:07.980 --> 05:09.920
and Master Zhang found out.

70
05:09.940 --> 05:11.140
Feiyan blew the scam.

71
05:11.220 --> 05:13.940
She and the Second Batou must be locked up at the Zhang residence by now.

72
05:13.940 --> 05:16.240
And now the Zhang family has called in the Salt Gang.

73
05:16.240 --> 05:17.790
The Salt Gang is not to be trifled with.

74
05:17.790 --> 05:19.620
Even I show them some respect.

75
05:19.870 --> 05:21.950
If we can't make up for the missing girl,

76
05:21.950 --> 05:24.810
how do you think the Salt Gang will deal with Feiyan?

77
05:25.310 --> 05:26.500
After thinking it over for a long time,

78
05:26.500 --> 05:28.900
I believe there's only one way now.

79
05:28.930 --> 05:30.980
You find that girl and kill her,

80
05:31.910 --> 05:33.980
and then the matter will be settled.

81
05:34.260 --> 05:35.870
Between Li Ling and Feiyan,

82
05:36.580 --> 05:38.190
you can only save one.

83
05:40.550 --> 05:41.880
Think it over yourself.

84
05:47.750 --> 05:48.750
Let's go?

85
05:53.580 --> 05:54.670
What are you doing?

86
05:54.670 --> 05:57.260
Zhang Yinhua discovered that she'd escaped and detained Jiang Feiyan.

87
05:57.260 --> 05:58.380
You have to come back with me to save her.

88
05:58.380 --> 05:59.900
She can't go back with you!

89
06:00.020 --> 06:01.580
If she doesn't go back, Jiang Feiyan will die!

90
06:01.580 --> 06:03.260
If she goes, she will die!

91
06:03.260 --> 06:04.750
Jiang Feiyan saved her life!

92
06:04.750 --> 06:06.220
Li Ling must come with me.

93
06:06.220 --> 06:06.820
No!

94
06:06.950 --> 06:07.780
She can't go with you!

95
06:07.780 --> 06:08.340
Let go!

96
06:08.340 --> 06:09.110
Let go of her!

97
06:09.110 --> 06:10.190
She can't go with you!

98
06:10.190 --> 06:11.510
My friend won't hurt you!

99
06:11.510 --> 06:12.440
She's not going!

100
06:12.950 --> 06:13.750
Aunt.

101
06:18.510 --> 06:19.950
I'll go with you.

102
06:20.020 --> 06:20.950
Li Ling!

103
06:20.950 --> 06:21.700
Aunt,

104
06:21.700 --> 06:24.030
Miss Jiang got into trouble because of me.

105
06:24.110 --> 06:25.630
I can't just leave her to die.

106
06:25.630 --> 06:26.510
But...

107
06:29.310 --> 06:30.020
Let's go.

108
06:30.870 --> 06:31.900
I'll go with you!

109
06:31.900 --> 06:33.360
If we die, we die together!

110
06:36.190 --> 06:37.110
Ma'am,

111
06:37.460 --> 06:38.510
I'm also trying to figure out a way.

112
06:38.510 --> 06:40.110
So don't make things harder.

113
06:40.990 --> 06:43.320
You've seen the Sect Master, haven't you?

114
06:43.630 --> 06:45.020
You're caving just like that?

115
06:45.020 --> 06:46.220
Are you really going to listen to him?

116
06:46.220 --> 06:48.310
Are you really going to send my niece to her death like this?

117
06:48.310 --> 06:49.380
Aunt,

118
06:49.380 --> 06:50.670
saving her is dangerous,

119
06:50.670 --> 06:51.670
but that doesn't mean I'll die.

120
06:51.670 --> 06:52.700
Stay out of it.

121
06:52.700 --> 06:53.870
Let me tell you,

122
06:54.310 --> 06:56.950
you don't have half the courage your mother had.

123
06:56.950 --> 06:58.780
When your mother saved me back then,

124
06:58.780 --> 07:02.260
she fought the Sect Master with her life on the line.

125
07:03.900 --> 07:05.070
You know my mother?

126
07:05.190 --> 07:06.460
Over 20 years ago,

127
07:06.750 --> 07:09.750
the Zhang family wanted to kill me and trap my soul too.

128
07:10.070 --> 07:11.800
It was your mother who saved me.

129
07:13.900 --> 07:16.460
She even wrote to me 3 months ago.

130
07:17.140 --> 07:18.260
Are you mistaken?

131
07:18.260 --> 07:19.630
Eight years ago, his mother, Shangguan Hong was...

132
07:19.630 --> 07:20.580
Liang.

133
07:23.380 --> 07:24.980
What did my mother say to you?

134
07:25.110 --> 07:27.380
She said she'd come to Yucheng to visit me in a few days.

135
07:27.380 --> 07:28.780
At that time, I was so worried

136
07:28.780 --> 07:30.670
about my niece's marriage to the Zhang family's son

137
07:30.670 --> 07:33.020
that I couldn't sleep for days.

138
07:33.020 --> 07:34.870
So I asked your mother to help me think of a way.

139
07:34.870 --> 07:35.870
Your mother told me

140
07:35.870 --> 07:38.510
to go directly to Yunhe Temple and ask for you.

141
07:38.510 --> 07:40.370
May you have infinite blessings.

142
07:40.550 --> 07:41.310
Then why didn't you

143
07:41.310 --> 07:42.780
just tell me directly at that time?

144
07:42.780 --> 07:44.580
Your mother told me you're warm-hearted

145
07:44.580 --> 07:45.630
and would definitely help me.

146
07:45.630 --> 07:46.870
Besides,

147
07:46.870 --> 07:48.950
didn't you fall out with your mother

148
07:48.950 --> 07:50.580
over joining the Tianxiang Sect?

149
07:50.580 --> 07:52.510
She said that if I mentioned her,

150
07:52.510 --> 07:54.510
you definitely wouldn't come.

151
07:54.510 --> 07:55.190
Such a serious matter—

152
07:55.190 --> 07:56.430
why didn't you tell me?

153
07:56.430 --> 07:57.890
What was I supposed to say?

154
07:57.950 --> 07:59.190
That Zhang boy was all you

155
07:59.190 --> 08:00.750
could see and think about.

156
08:00.750 --> 08:03.080
Would telling you have changed anything?

157
08:05.110 --> 08:07.510
That letter was written by the Sect Master.

158
08:08.220 --> 08:10.510
My mother died 8 years ago.

159
08:12.260 --> 08:13.870
But the Sect Master went to such great lengths

160
08:13.870 --> 08:15.460
to involve you in this scam...

161
08:15.460 --> 08:16.920
What exactly does he want?

162
08:17.220 --> 08:18.900
He has something to say to me.

163
08:19.750 --> 08:22.190
Ma'am, tell me

164
08:22.190 --> 08:24.050
what exactly happened back then.

165
08:24.110 --> 08:25.260
Back then,

166
08:25.630 --> 08:26.750
your mother told me everything

167
08:26.750 --> 08:29.110
about the soul-trapping.

168
08:29.670 --> 08:31.140
To explain all this,

169
08:31.870 --> 08:34.309
we have to start with my brother's death.

170
08:38.059 --> 08:40.309
[Thirty years ago]

171
08:42.400 --> 08:43.960
[Young Sect Master Zhou Xingsi]

172
08:49.090 --> 08:50.320
[Shangguan Hong]

173
09:38.780 --> 09:40.020
This is not good.

174
09:41.390 --> 09:42.220
Master,

175
09:42.700 --> 09:44.030
what do you mean?

176
09:44.270 --> 09:46.210
After the soul-trapping ritual was performed,

177
09:46.210 --> 09:48.210
your son's career soared,

178
09:48.230 --> 09:49.490
and he rose to a high office.

179
09:49.490 --> 09:50.810
But as the saying goes,

180
09:51.670 --> 09:53.470
"It's bitterly cold at the top."

181
09:54.070 --> 09:55.790
Master, you mean

182
09:56.390 --> 09:57.620
my son is in danger?

183
09:57.670 --> 10:00.740
Your son now holds a high position and is respected by all,

184
10:00.740 --> 10:02.460
but danger lurks everywhere.

185
10:02.580 --> 10:04.910
Although I've replaced the soul-suppressing nail for you,

186
10:04.910 --> 10:06.340
Madam Zhang's help

187
10:06.340 --> 10:07.860
has been weakening.

188
10:07.860 --> 10:09.430
I'm afraid she can no longer help sustain

189
10:09.430 --> 10:10.700
your family's fortune.

190
10:10.700 --> 10:12.620
You must find a new subject for another soul-trapping ritual

191
10:12.620 --> 10:14.950
as soon as possible.

192
10:27.270 --> 10:28.220
Master Li,

193
10:28.580 --> 10:30.340
the higher the position,

194
10:30.420 --> 10:32.820
the deeper the nail must be driven.

195
10:40.820 --> 10:42.150
You fraud!

196
10:42.210 --> 10:44.420
I've never forgotten what you did to my mother.

197
10:44.060 --> 10:45.490
[Li Yingfu]

198
10:44.550 --> 10:46.390
And you still dare to show your faces?

199
10:46.390 --> 10:47.430
Yingfu,

200
10:47.500 --> 10:48.910
absolutely not!

201
10:49.100 --> 10:50.430
Without Master's protection,

202
10:50.430 --> 10:51.950
how could you have the wealth and status you enjoy today?

203
10:51.950 --> 10:52.860
Father,

204
10:52.950 --> 10:54.210
I got to where I am today

205
10:54.390 --> 10:56.030
by putting my life on the line

206
10:56.150 --> 10:57.430
and fighting for it myself!

207
10:57.430 --> 10:58.150
Yingfu,

208
10:58.150 --> 10:59.670
calm down.

209
11:00.270 --> 11:01.030
Master,

210
11:01.340 --> 11:03.100
my son is still young.

211
11:03.100 --> 11:04.820
Please don't take offense.

212
11:05.030 --> 11:05.860
It's fine.

213
11:06.910 --> 11:08.670
Your son is just consumed by a surge of evil fire.

214
11:08.670 --> 11:09.310
Just find

215
11:09.310 --> 11:11.740
a Xuanwu statue blessed at a pure water ritual altar,

216
11:11.740 --> 11:13.030
and it will protect his fortune.

217
11:13.030 --> 11:14.150
Fooling the people

218
11:14.150 --> 11:16.210
with your sham supernatural tricks!

219
11:17.820 --> 11:18.550
Yingfu!

220
11:22.500 --> 11:23.910
You unfilial son,

221
11:24.390 --> 11:25.580
everyone believes it

222
11:25.580 --> 11:26.460
except you.

223
11:26.550 --> 11:27.310
If you keep this up,

224
11:27.310 --> 11:28.910
you'll be the ruin of the whole Li family!

225
11:28.910 --> 11:30.580
You'll be the one to blame!

226
11:30.980 --> 11:31.860
Don't go!

227
11:36.670 --> 11:37.670
You fraud!

228
11:43.740 --> 11:45.420
How dare you touch me?

229
11:46.430 --> 11:47.030
That slap of yours

230
11:47.030 --> 11:49.160
has cost you some of your own lifespan.

231
11:50.780 --> 11:53.030
And your family will also suffer a great disaster because of this.

232
11:53.030 --> 11:54.390
Three days from now, at a quarter to six in the evening,

233
11:54.390 --> 11:58.460
7 leaves will fall from the old osmanthus tree in the southeast corner of your house.

234
11:58.460 --> 11:59.860
When the 7th leaf falls,

235
11:59.860 --> 12:01.800
you'll know what a great disaster is.

236
12:01.800 --> 12:04.390
You're facing a great disaster right now.

237
12:05.310 --> 12:06.190
Take them away!

238
12:06.190 --> 12:06.860
Yes, sir!

239
12:07.550 --> 12:09.070
Yingfu! Yingfu,

240
12:09.070 --> 12:10.740
you mustn't, Yingfu!

241
12:11.310 --> 12:12.150
Yingfu!

242
12:12.740 --> 12:13.420
Master.

243
12:14.370 --> 12:15.180
Master.

244
12:15.210 --> 12:17.790
[Young Zhang Yinhua]

245
12:15.460 --> 12:16.340
I'm sorry.

246
12:16.460 --> 12:17.310
Yingfu!

247
12:17.950 --> 12:18.910
Yingfu!

248
12:35.200 --> 12:35.960
Hong,

249
12:36.460 --> 12:37.190
what's wrong with you today?

250
12:37.190 --> 12:38.590
Are you not feeling well?

251
12:42.150 --> 12:45.590
Are you still planning to perform the soul-trapping ritual for the Li family?

252
12:45.590 --> 12:47.280
That will lead to murder.

253
12:51.650 --> 12:53.170
When you mentioned

254
12:53.200 --> 12:55.730
-those 7 falling leaves today... -I can't...

255
12:56.740 --> 12:58.340
let that slap go unanswered.

256
12:58.780 --> 13:00.510
Can you spare Li Yingfu's life?

257
13:02.740 --> 13:03.590
Okay.

258
13:55.040 --> 13:56.390
Can you hear me?

259
13:56.420 --> 13:58.780
Blink if you can.

260
14:01.210 --> 14:03.070
How dare you hit our grandmaster?

261
14:12.010 --> 14:12.820
Boss,

262
14:13.210 --> 14:15.030
should we stab him from the mouth down

263
14:15.030 --> 14:16.460
or from the bottom up?

264
14:16.580 --> 14:17.500
Let's bet on it.

265
14:17.500 --> 14:18.860
The winner drinks for free tonight.

266
14:18.860 --> 14:20.550
Heads or tails?

267
14:20.550 --> 14:20.860
Tails.

268
14:20.860 --> 14:21.460
Heads.

269
14:21.460 --> 14:22.430
Tails.

270
14:22.430 --> 14:23.860
Tails.

271
14:29.310 --> 14:30.100
Flip him over.

272
14:30.100 --> 14:30.950
Alright.

273
14:46.950 --> 14:47.820
Terrible news!

274
14:47.820 --> 14:48.550
Something happened to Young Master!

275
14:48.550 --> 14:49.950
Somebody come, quickly!

276
15:05.970 --> 15:09.650
[Young Li Yingjuan]

277
15:13.290 --> 15:15.620
There are no visible injuries on his body.

278
15:15.910 --> 15:17.770
Take the body back and examine it.

279
15:18.310 --> 15:20.100
This guy was on bad terms with our boss.

280
15:20.100 --> 15:20.950
Did you forget?

281
15:20.950 --> 15:22.530
Taking him back will just get us scolded.

282
15:22.530 --> 15:23.770
Officers.

283
15:28.730 --> 15:30.260
Thank you for your trouble.

284
15:30.340 --> 15:30.900
Let's go!

285
15:30.920 --> 15:31.500
Go.

286
15:36.790 --> 15:37.670
Burn him quickly.

287
15:37.670 --> 15:38.460
Yes, Master.

288
15:38.950 --> 15:39.790
Wait!

289
15:40.190 --> 15:40.860
Father.

290
15:42.340 --> 15:43.790
He was your own son.

291
15:43.950 --> 15:45.100
You can't do this.

292
15:45.150 --> 15:46.100
Enough.

293
15:48.150 --> 15:49.290
Look.

294
15:49.500 --> 15:51.440
Ever since the day he caused trouble,

295
15:51.440 --> 15:53.320
the pond in the north has dried up.

296
15:53.740 --> 15:56.350
Crows fly over our yard every day,

297
15:56.520 --> 15:59.040
and our livestock are all listless.

298
15:59.140 --> 16:00.380
Such a sinful wretch,

299
16:00.500 --> 16:02.140
and you still want him buried in the ancestral grave?

300
16:02.140 --> 16:04.030
Even if you won't bury him in the ancestral grave,

301
16:04.030 --> 16:05.550
you must leave his body intact!

302
16:05.550 --> 16:06.070
No.

303
16:06.460 --> 16:07.860
Absolutely not.

304
16:08.860 --> 16:11.190
We must burn this sinful wretch to ashes.

305
16:11.390 --> 16:12.700
If we keep the body intact,

306
16:12.700 --> 16:14.860
he might come back to harm the family.

307
16:15.740 --> 16:16.430
Take the body away!

308
16:16.430 --> 16:16.980
Yes!

309
16:25.070 --> 16:25.790
It's okay.

310
16:26.500 --> 16:27.550
I'm here.

311
16:37.950 --> 16:39.070
You two can go now.

312
16:40.340 --> 16:41.540
Thank you, officers.

313
16:46.500 --> 16:47.560
Taoist Priestess,

314
16:48.270 --> 16:48.860
Master,

315
16:49.500 --> 16:50.820
you two have suffered.

316
16:51.150 --> 16:52.740
Li Yingfu sent you?

317
16:53.030 --> 16:55.160
Li Yingfu had no reverence for Heaven,

318
16:55.480 --> 16:57.030
provoking the wrath of Heaven and men.

319
16:57.030 --> 16:57.700
That...

320
17:00.670 --> 17:03.220
That guy got what he deserved.

321
17:06.680 --> 17:09.410
I came here today specifically to get you two out,

322
17:09.589 --> 17:12.869
and I also have a favor to ask.

323
17:13.119 --> 17:14.500
I'm getting married soon.

324
17:14.500 --> 17:16.030
You want us to pray for your marriage?

325
17:16.030 --> 17:17.950
I'm going to marry the Li family's daughter,

326
17:17.950 --> 17:19.150
Li Yingjuan.

327
17:19.150 --> 17:22.550
I've heard that the more deeply the woman you marry loves you,

328
17:22.670 --> 17:24.349
the more fortune

329
17:24.930 --> 17:27.930
her trapped soul brings your family.

330
17:28.460 --> 17:30.490
The soul-trapping ritual doesn't work on just anyone!

331
17:30.490 --> 17:32.580
This ritual is very important to me.

332
17:32.730 --> 17:34.250
I have a friend in Lindi

333
17:34.410 --> 17:36.810
who has asked me to arrange canal transport

334
17:37.150 --> 17:38.460
to smuggle some salt.

335
17:38.460 --> 17:41.060
You know, smuggling salt is...

336
17:42.740 --> 17:44.590
If I can pull this deal off,

337
17:44.620 --> 17:47.170
I'll be set for life.

338
17:50.660 --> 17:53.030
So you must watch over me

339
17:53.300 --> 17:56.590
and ensure this deal goes smoothly and safely.

340
17:57.780 --> 17:58.350
Sir...

341
17:58.460 --> 17:59.460
Sir,

342
17:59.950 --> 18:01.910
the soul-trapping ritual costs lives

343
18:01.910 --> 18:04.220
and will drain my cultivation greatly.

344
18:07.670 --> 18:08.950
Exactly so.

345
18:13.430 --> 18:15.390
If you two find it too difficult,

346
18:15.780 --> 18:17.630
I shall not impose upon you.

347
18:17.950 --> 18:18.740
I'll just...

348
18:19.670 --> 18:21.270
find another Taoist master.

349
18:26.740 --> 18:27.670
Hong.

350
18:29.670 --> 18:31.800
I know you don't want me to kill anyone.

351
18:32.170 --> 18:33.350
How about this? I promise you,

352
18:33.350 --> 18:34.460
I won't get involved in matters

353
18:34.460 --> 18:36.830
concerning the Zhang or Li families again.

354
18:36.830 --> 18:37.670
Okay?

355
18:48.370 --> 18:49.200
Sir.

356
18:52.570 --> 18:53.480
Sir,

357
18:53.500 --> 18:56.070
please give me your Four Pillars of Destiny and your bride's.

358
18:56.070 --> 18:57.730
Thank you, Taoist Priestess.

359
19:01.750 --> 19:03.010
You're a fraud.

360
19:05.580 --> 19:06.820
I am a fraud.

361
19:07.530 --> 19:09.500
This soul-trapping ritual is a scam,

362
19:09.500 --> 19:11.350
but not everyone can pull it off.

363
19:11.380 --> 19:13.540
I saw what Li Yingfu would go on to accomplish.

364
19:13.540 --> 19:15.190
Anyone who joins Lord Yuan's New Army these days

365
19:15.190 --> 19:17.050
is sure to rise through the ranks.

366
19:17.210 --> 19:19.060
I merely went with the flow.

367
19:20.840 --> 19:22.880
You clearly said you wouldn't kill him.

368
19:22.880 --> 19:25.500
Li Yingfu believed we'd scammed his whole family.

369
19:25.500 --> 19:26.740
He'd already flipped the table.

370
19:26.740 --> 19:27.830
If I hadn't killed him,

371
19:27.830 --> 19:28.670
our bodies would be floating

372
19:28.670 --> 19:30.150
in the Jialing River by tomorrow morning.

373
19:30.150 --> 19:31.980
Then we could've just not done the ritual

374
19:31.980 --> 19:32.810
and walked away.

375
19:32.810 --> 19:35.390
This is the scam handed to us personally by the old Sect Master.

376
19:35.390 --> 19:37.510
Back then, when he ran a scam on the Elder Brothers Society,

377
19:37.510 --> 19:38.500
he personally threw

378
19:38.500 --> 19:41.790
his nephew into the furnace to keep the scam from being exposed.

379
19:41.790 --> 19:43.070
He set the rule—

380
19:43.110 --> 19:44.780
whoever ruins the sect's business

381
19:44.780 --> 19:46.510
must take the fall for the sect.

382
19:48.280 --> 19:50.740
Right now, we're choosing a new Sect Master.

383
19:51.270 --> 19:53.200
The other Batous are all watching.

384
19:53.300 --> 19:54.690
If I mess up this scam,

385
19:54.720 --> 19:56.670
I'll never be able to turn things around.

386
19:56.670 --> 19:58.220
When another Batou becomes the Sect Master,

387
19:58.220 --> 19:59.670
they'll definitely kill me.

388
19:59.670 --> 20:01.200
And once I die, you're next.

389
20:06.110 --> 20:07.220
I'm a fraud.

390
20:07.220 --> 20:08.790
You're right not to trust me.

391
20:08.790 --> 20:09.830
But don't forget

392
20:10.020 --> 20:11.910
why Zhang Yinhua came to you.

393
20:14.820 --> 20:17.620
You're the one who brought out the darkness in him,

394
20:17.840 --> 20:20.300
and that's why he wants a soul-trapping ritual.

395
20:20.300 --> 20:22.460
You think a few words could tempt him?

396
20:22.630 --> 20:24.910
Li Yingfu's success made him jealous.

397
20:25.150 --> 20:27.480
Even if you don't do it, someone else will.

398
20:28.980 --> 20:30.780
I'm very good at reading people.

399
20:31.020 --> 20:32.460
Zhang Yinhua is a ruthless man.

400
20:32.460 --> 20:33.700
Now his canal transport business

401
20:33.700 --> 20:36.020
has everything going for it.

402
20:36.500 --> 20:38.590
All he wants is some reassurance.

403
20:38.590 --> 20:40.390
By then, if he finds someone at random to perform the ritual

404
20:40.390 --> 20:41.790
and then makes a fortune,

405
20:41.830 --> 20:42.740
he'll come to believe in it completely

406
20:42.740 --> 20:44.400
and keep having it performed.

407
20:49.950 --> 20:50.750
Seal the soul.

408
21:46.340 --> 21:49.100
[Li Yingjuan]

409
21:56.530 --> 21:57.440
Come out first.

410
22:01.830 --> 22:02.830
It's alright now.

411
22:04.220 --> 22:05.300
It's alright now.

412
22:05.840 --> 22:08.120
Let me take the nail out of your head.

413
22:16.180 --> 22:17.150
It's okay now.

414
22:18.880 --> 22:19.670
Let's go.

415
22:33.190 --> 22:34.590
Don't be afraid. It's me.

416
22:35.540 --> 22:36.740
I brought you some food.

417
22:36.740 --> 22:38.180
There are some dry clothes inside.

418
22:38.180 --> 22:39.840
Come on, let's leave quickly.

419
22:41.590 --> 22:42.720
Search everywhere!

420
22:42.870 --> 22:43.590
This way.

421
22:44.950 --> 22:46.280
-This way! -Be careful.

422
22:47.220 --> 22:47.910
Hurry!

423
22:48.780 --> 22:49.980
Don't let her escape!

424
22:51.190 --> 22:52.060
Find her!

425
22:53.220 --> 22:54.350
Search everywhere!

426
22:58.380 --> 23:00.130
Is my family here looking for me?

427
23:00.130 --> 23:01.540
Those are people from the Tianxiang Sect.

428
23:01.540 --> 23:02.500
You go quickly.

429
23:02.530 --> 23:03.400
This way!

430
23:04.020 --> 23:04.590
Go.

431
23:04.590 --> 23:05.630
What about you?

432
23:06.580 --> 23:07.930
I'll go stall them.

433
23:08.830 --> 23:10.350
Otherwise, neither of us

434
23:10.980 --> 23:12.640
will make it through tonight.

435
23:13.060 --> 23:13.910
Go.

436
23:14.700 --> 23:15.540
Go!

437
23:48.180 --> 23:49.140
Grandmaster.

438
23:50.020 --> 23:50.670
Take her away.

439
23:50.670 --> 23:51.390
-Yes. -Yes.

440
23:58.430 --> 23:59.500
Grandmaster.

441
23:59.780 --> 24:00.840
Where is Shangguan Hong?

442
24:00.840 --> 24:03.150
We couldn't stop her. She went down the mountain.

443
24:03.150 --> 24:04.280
Should we chase her?

444
24:05.870 --> 24:06.870
Back to the sect.

445
24:07.220 --> 24:07.910
Yes.

446
24:14.040 --> 24:17.080
She knows you and Shangguan Hong are in this together.

447
24:17.370 --> 24:21.050
If she tells people how Li Yingfu really died,

448
24:21.340 --> 24:23.780
then our scam will be

449
24:24.500 --> 24:25.910
completely blown.

450
24:26.230 --> 24:29.840
Shangguan Hong has betrayed our Tianxiang Sect.

451
24:30.430 --> 24:31.460
Her life...

452
24:32.540 --> 24:34.060
no longer belongs to her.

453
24:34.220 --> 24:36.280
I've issued an order to hunt her down.

454
24:36.460 --> 24:37.740
We should keep

455
24:38.020 --> 24:39.590
our troubles

456
24:39.850 --> 24:41.370
behind closed doors.

457
24:43.430 --> 24:46.910
I know you and Shangguan Hong are quite close.

458
24:47.050 --> 24:49.050
So I'm saving your face.

459
24:49.260 --> 24:53.220
But you can't make me lose mine.

460
24:54.460 --> 24:55.220
Master,

461
24:56.220 --> 24:57.540
Li Yingjuan can't die.

462
24:57.740 --> 24:58.770
As long as she lives,

463
24:58.770 --> 25:00.420
your reputation remains intact.

464
25:00.420 --> 25:02.430
Li Yingfu's body has already been burned.

465
25:02.430 --> 25:04.840
Even if the government want to investigate, they won't find anything.

466
25:04.840 --> 25:06.370
And you taught me yourself:

467
25:06.390 --> 25:09.150
fear is the best way to make money.

468
25:10.120 --> 25:11.600
I want to take her back,

469
25:11.830 --> 25:13.150
so whenever people see this madwoman,

470
25:13.150 --> 25:14.460
they'll think of you.

471
25:14.830 --> 25:16.110
And they'll all

472
25:16.660 --> 25:17.740
revere you

473
25:18.150 --> 25:19.260
like a god.

474
25:39.220 --> 25:40.020
You're awake.

475
25:41.020 --> 25:42.620
The drug hasn't worn off yet.

476
25:42.720 --> 25:44.580
You'll be fine in a couple of days.

477
25:47.430 --> 25:48.960
Where... are you taking me?

478
25:49.430 --> 25:50.320
Home.

479
26:02.030 --> 26:03.740
[Li Residence]

480
26:18.910 --> 26:20.970
Give her this bowl of talisman water.

481
26:20.980 --> 26:21.870
Okay, okay.

482
26:25.260 --> 26:27.260
The Zhang family has trapped her soul.

483
26:27.260 --> 26:29.050
I performed rituals for 3 straight days

484
26:29.050 --> 26:31.310
and only managed to bring back her 1 soul and 1 spirit.

485
26:31.310 --> 26:32.420
The Zhangs...

486
26:32.500 --> 26:34.780
I'll fight them to the death!

487
26:35.740 --> 26:37.220
I've done a reading for you.

488
26:37.220 --> 26:39.510
If you clash with the Zhangs again,

489
26:40.100 --> 26:42.140
your family will face utter ruin.

490
26:43.020 --> 26:45.740
After all, the Zhangs have the Salt Gang behind them.

491
26:45.740 --> 26:46.780
I advise you

492
26:46.780 --> 26:48.110
to let go of this grudge.

493
26:48.430 --> 26:49.350
Over the next few days,

494
26:49.350 --> 26:51.060
I'll continue to perform rituals for Li Yingjuan,

495
26:51.060 --> 26:53.460
and her souls and spirits will naturally return.

496
26:53.460 --> 26:55.780
But from now on, you must hide her well

497
26:56.300 --> 26:58.830
and not let the Zhangs know she's still alive.

498
27:02.700 --> 27:03.390
Okay.

499
27:04.350 --> 27:05.020
Okay.

500
27:06.390 --> 27:07.740
Thank you, Master.

501
27:09.390 --> 27:10.150
Go.

502
27:10.260 --> 27:11.210
Leave.

503
27:21.220 --> 27:22.700
If I'd acted as I normally would,

504
27:22.700 --> 27:24.590
you would've been dead long ago.

505
27:26.540 --> 27:27.910
But for Shangguan Hong's sake,

506
27:27.910 --> 27:29.060
I'll spare you.

507
27:29.300 --> 27:31.500
Now cooperate with me to finish the act.

508
27:37.230 --> 27:38.460
At that time, I thought

509
27:38.460 --> 27:40.460
the matter of the soul-trapping ritual had ended there.

510
27:40.460 --> 27:41.950
Who would have thought that, only some years later,

511
27:41.950 --> 27:44.780
Zhang Yinhua would want another soul-trapping ritual?

512
27:44.780 --> 27:48.180
And the helper he found turned out to be the Sect Master again.

513
27:48.220 --> 27:51.330
Zhang Yinhua's coughing up blood must also have been arranged by the Sect Master.

514
27:51.330 --> 27:53.960
I even suspect that Li Ling's marriage,

515
27:54.460 --> 27:56.860
and what you told me about him and my mother,

516
27:57.500 --> 27:59.360
are all part of his calculations.

517
28:00.870 --> 28:02.800
But I still have to thank you, Aunt,

518
28:03.220 --> 28:04.950
for letting me pick up on something.

519
28:04.950 --> 28:05.590
Wait.

520
28:06.020 --> 28:08.220
Why didn't I pick up anything from that?

521
28:08.300 --> 28:11.170
I just think that the Sect Master is a good person.

522
28:11.350 --> 28:12.910
He didn't want to kill anyone either.

523
28:12.910 --> 28:14.500
He was forced into it.

524
28:14.500 --> 28:15.300
That's right.

525
28:15.850 --> 28:18.110
That's exactly what he wanted to tell me.

526
28:18.910 --> 28:20.300
Now you've stopped believing in him, haven't you?

527
28:20.300 --> 28:21.220
His son

528
28:21.220 --> 28:23.390
must know what his father is up to.

529
28:28.390 --> 28:30.720
A car has been following us the whole time.

530
28:33.780 --> 28:35.780
It looks like the Sixth Batou's car.

531
28:35.910 --> 28:37.260
Then why don't we...

532
28:39.110 --> 28:40.310
play along and beat them at their own game?

533
28:40.310 --> 28:43.750
[Zhang Residence]

534
28:52.370 --> 28:53.340
Sleepy?

535
28:53.910 --> 28:56.330
Our Salt Gang is short of everything but salt.

536
28:56.330 --> 28:57.050
Go.

537
28:57.450 --> 28:58.820
Wake him up.

538
29:25.910 --> 29:27.020
Awake now?

539
29:27.630 --> 29:28.260
Tell us!

540
29:28.390 --> 29:30.670
Where did you take the woman from the vat?

541
29:33.700 --> 29:34.500
I

542
29:35.390 --> 29:37.220
have told you many times.

543
29:37.460 --> 29:38.950
I've cooperated with the Zhang family for years

544
29:38.950 --> 29:40.700
and never made a mistake.

545
29:40.900 --> 29:44.110
This time, some expert must've come after the Zhang family.

546
29:44.110 --> 29:47.390
Master Zhang wants us to get to the bottom of this today.

547
29:48.460 --> 29:50.780
Priestess, I don't want to lay a hand on you.

548
29:50.780 --> 29:51.830
But if you don't

549
29:51.880 --> 29:53.780
give me an answer by the end of today,

550
29:53.780 --> 29:55.500
I'll have to give you both a taste

551
29:55.500 --> 29:57.110
of what we can do!

552
29:59.110 --> 30:00.390
In the soul-trapping ritual,

553
30:00.390 --> 30:02.220
we first have to break down the physical body,

554
30:02.220 --> 30:04.070
then gather the 3 souls and 6 spirits.

555
30:04.070 --> 30:05.130
Now look what happened.

556
30:05.130 --> 30:06.740
We'd only just finished the first step

557
30:06.740 --> 30:07.900
and hadn't gathered the souls yet.

558
30:07.900 --> 30:09.700
And Master Zhang opened the vat!

559
30:09.700 --> 30:11.580
How could Li Ling's soul not scatter?

560
30:11.580 --> 30:12.880
You can't blame us for this.

561
30:12.880 --> 30:15.260
Even if you beat him to death today, it won't help.

562
30:15.260 --> 30:16.110
Understand?

563
30:17.300 --> 30:18.230
What did she say?

564
30:18.730 --> 30:19.930
Did you understand?

565
30:24.060 --> 30:26.390
I know.

566
30:26.510 --> 30:28.560
It's just like mining salt.

567
30:28.740 --> 30:30.590
First, remove impurities from the brine,

568
30:30.590 --> 30:31.980
then boil it down into salt.

569
30:31.980 --> 30:34.190
Just like breaking it apart and regrouping it.

570
30:34.190 --> 30:36.500
Boiling salt and soul-trapping are the same thing.

571
30:36.500 --> 30:38.190
That makes sense.

572
30:38.350 --> 30:40.460
Come with me to see Master Zhang.

573
30:40.460 --> 30:41.630
I'm afraid I can't explain it clearly.

574
30:41.630 --> 30:42.980
Alright, alright!

575
30:51.740 --> 30:53.000
You did it, didn't you?

576
30:53.780 --> 30:55.780
And that brat Shangguan Chengming.

577
30:57.460 --> 31:00.390
I knew it. When you're with him,

578
31:00.830 --> 31:02.630
you must be up to no good.

579
31:04.780 --> 31:05.700
This...

580
31:06.590 --> 31:08.050
has nothing to do with him.

581
31:09.020 --> 31:09.780
Yanzi,

582
31:10.670 --> 31:12.150
are you taking me for a fool?

583
31:12.150 --> 31:13.870
How could he have nothing to do with this?

584
31:13.870 --> 31:15.670
I must've owed you in a past life.

585
31:22.910 --> 31:24.310
I just don't understand.

586
31:25.020 --> 31:26.190
All these years,

587
31:26.780 --> 31:30.190
we've been through thick and thin together, escorting goods and running scams.

588
31:30.190 --> 31:32.450
I've taken the fall for you so many times,

589
31:32.780 --> 31:34.640
and I've never once regretted it.

590
31:35.500 --> 31:36.060
But...

591
31:36.830 --> 31:39.490
what has Shangguan Chengming ever done for you?

592
32:08.270 --> 32:08.900
Master,

593
32:09.230 --> 32:11.550
the Zhang residence is just around the bend.

594
32:11.550 --> 32:13.110
Looks like he has no choice.

595
32:13.150 --> 32:13.910
In the end,

596
32:13.910 --> 32:17.110
he still has to kill Li Ling for the soul-trapping ritual.

597
32:53.460 --> 32:54.190
What...

598
32:54.820 --> 32:56.080
What's wrong with her?

599
32:56.390 --> 32:57.740
You know her?

600
32:58.020 --> 33:00.780
Then I came to the right place.

601
33:01.110 --> 33:03.220
Last night, I was wandering along the road to the underworld

602
33:03.220 --> 33:05.100
and having a pleasant chat with Meng Po.

603
33:05.100 --> 33:08.420
Suddenly, I saw a girl standing on the Bridge of Oblivion.

604
33:08.440 --> 33:11.060
She just stood there, dazed, and wouldn't cross.

605
33:11.060 --> 33:12.220
So I asked her,

606
33:12.430 --> 33:13.950
"Are you lost?"

607
33:14.020 --> 33:15.980
She said she couldn't leave

608
33:16.150 --> 33:18.020
because her soul was trapped.

609
33:18.020 --> 33:20.670
Then I asked her who had trapped her soul.

610
33:21.020 --> 33:22.500
She then led me

611
33:22.980 --> 33:24.910
to your residence.

612
33:26.910 --> 33:30.430
Then is she a living person or a ghost?

613
33:30.480 --> 33:32.870
The living and the dead belong to different realms.

614
33:32.870 --> 33:34.780
She is caught somewhere in between—

615
33:34.780 --> 33:36.180
neither human nor ghost,

616
33:36.430 --> 33:37.780
both alive and dead.

617
33:38.180 --> 33:41.420
May I ask, sir, who you really are?

618
33:41.750 --> 33:43.990
I have walked through the Celestial Masters' Hall

619
33:43.990 --> 33:46.060
and torn pages from the Book of Life and Death.

620
33:46.060 --> 33:48.460
Now I conceal my deeds and fame

621
33:48.930 --> 33:52.620
and live as a carefree hermit in the mountains.

622
34:15.750 --> 34:17.010
Forgive my frankness,

623
34:17.500 --> 34:18.460
old sir,

624
34:19.020 --> 34:21.480
but there seem to be quite a few lost girls...

625
34:22.980 --> 34:24.350
at your residence.

626
34:26.860 --> 34:28.050
Where

627
34:28.580 --> 34:29.949
are they?

628
34:30.050 --> 34:32.380
Aren't they right here in your courtyard,

629
34:33.250 --> 34:34.600
following you?

630
34:43.949 --> 34:44.949
Master,

631
34:46.020 --> 34:49.460
please don't joke with an old man like me.

632
34:50.489 --> 34:52.530
Since I've delivered her,

633
34:53.120 --> 34:54.600
I should take my leave.

634
34:54.870 --> 34:56.750
But let me remind you:

635
34:57.139 --> 34:58.430
she is now neither human nor ghost,

636
34:58.430 --> 34:59.890
a creature of extreme Yin.

637
35:00.810 --> 35:02.440
Whoever touches her dies.

638
35:05.710 --> 35:06.390
Let's go.

639
35:08.060 --> 35:08.790
Master,

640
35:09.060 --> 35:10.140
please wait.

641
35:12.660 --> 35:14.540
I'm old,

642
35:14.710 --> 35:18.020
and I'd like your help finding a way

643
35:18.270 --> 35:21.660
to lay this girl's wandering soul to rest.

644
35:22.310 --> 35:24.750
Whoever started the trouble should end it.

645
35:24.980 --> 35:26.460
You have to tell me honestly

646
35:26.460 --> 35:27.870
how she died,

647
35:28.140 --> 35:30.100
and only then can I help you find

648
35:30.790 --> 35:32.310
a way to resolve it.

649
35:34.710 --> 35:37.350
She died suddenly

650
35:38.180 --> 35:39.310
on the wedding night.

651
35:39.310 --> 35:40.710
A young maiden,

652
35:40.710 --> 35:42.710
with no illness or health problems,

653
35:42.950 --> 35:44.140
just dropped dead?

654
35:44.500 --> 35:46.160
That is indeed what happened.

655
35:46.660 --> 35:48.710
Her death is so mysterious,

656
35:48.710 --> 35:51.430
and her resentment won't fade anytime soon.

657
35:51.580 --> 35:53.230
I have to take her away,

658
35:53.350 --> 35:56.100
lock her up at my master's retreat deep in the mountains,

659
35:56.100 --> 35:58.270
and seal her with a soul-suppressing rite.

660
35:58.270 --> 36:01.310
That way, Li Ling's soul can pass into its next life?

661
36:01.340 --> 36:02.340
Not necessarily.

662
36:02.350 --> 36:04.860
This ritual will take at least a week.

663
36:04.890 --> 36:05.830
During that time,

664
36:05.830 --> 36:07.970
she can leave her physical body and roam freely.

665
36:07.970 --> 36:10.350
You and your family must be extremely careful,

666
36:10.350 --> 36:11.810
lest she possess one of you

667
36:12.230 --> 36:13.760
and bring ruin upon you all.

668
36:14.220 --> 36:16.550
The eyes are both the entrance and the exit.

669
36:16.550 --> 36:19.680
Everyone in your household who has seen Miss Li Ling

670
36:19.860 --> 36:21.830
must drink water with these talismans

671
36:21.830 --> 36:23.980
to stay safe.

672
36:24.860 --> 36:25.860
Old sir,

673
36:26.100 --> 36:26.950
always let

674
36:27.100 --> 36:28.500
compassion guide you.

675
36:28.790 --> 36:29.870
I can sense

676
36:29.870 --> 36:32.790
that there are cultivators staying in your residence.

677
36:32.790 --> 36:34.870
I hope you treat them well,

678
36:34.870 --> 36:37.140
lest you damage your own karmic virtue

679
36:38.210 --> 36:40.610
and give the wandering souls following you

680
36:41.060 --> 36:42.710
an opening.

681
36:52.190 --> 36:52.790
Wait,

682
36:53.050 --> 36:54.780
why have they brought her out?

683
36:55.180 --> 36:56.750
Keep a close eye on them.

684
36:58.230 --> 36:59.350
G-Got it, Master.

685
37:05.910 --> 37:06.640
Master.

686
37:08.810 --> 37:09.870
Shangguan Chengming

687
37:09.870 --> 37:12.020
took Li Ling to the Zhang residence

688
37:13.620 --> 37:15.280
but then brought her back out.

689
37:16.430 --> 37:17.540
Interesting.

690
37:19.620 --> 37:22.080
When do you think the fish will take the bait?

691
37:37.450 --> 37:38.910
Master Zhang has ordered:

692
37:39.230 --> 37:40.750
finish the talisman water,

693
37:40.750 --> 37:42.230
not a drop left!

694
38:06.660 --> 38:07.350
Let's go.

695
38:09.090 --> 38:10.970
Aunt, wait for us in the car.

696
38:13.100 --> 38:14.070
Be careful.

697
38:28.270 --> 38:30.020
Looks like they've all drunk the talisman water.

698
38:30.020 --> 38:31.950
You guys go move Zhang Yuanfan out.

699
38:32.270 --> 38:33.140
I'll go find Jiang Feiyan.

700
38:33.140 --> 38:33.870
Okay.

701
38:34.500 --> 38:35.230
Let's go.

702
38:51.250 --> 38:53.520
He won't wake up suddenly, will he?

703
38:53.660 --> 38:54.660
Watch.

704
38:56.980 --> 38:57.940
He won't wake up.

705
38:59.100 --> 39:00.540
This brat clearly knows about the soul-trapping ritual.

706
39:00.540 --> 39:01.670
He just wanted to harm you.

707
39:01.670 --> 39:04.470
Why don't you hit him a few times to vent your anger?

708
39:06.490 --> 39:07.130
Come on.

709
39:09.860 --> 39:11.060
Enough, enough.

710
39:17.530 --> 39:18.260
No...

711
39:18.280 --> 39:19.480
Don't do it like that.

712
39:20.100 --> 39:21.420
What are you doing?

713
39:21.450 --> 39:22.910
Didn't you say he wouldn't wake up?

714
39:22.910 --> 39:25.510
This would be way too painful. You'll wake him.

715
39:53.010 --> 39:55.180
Second Master, what are you doing?

716
39:55.840 --> 39:57.280
I know that brat is here.

717
39:57.410 --> 39:58.700
The moment he shows up,

718
39:58.840 --> 40:00.070
I'll kill him.

719
40:03.100 --> 40:03.960
Second Master.

720
40:04.270 --> 40:05.870
As long as that kid is around,

721
40:06.430 --> 40:08.490
he'll get you killed sooner or later.

722
40:08.950 --> 40:09.810
Second Master.

723
40:10.020 --> 40:10.910
Second Master!

724
40:19.900 --> 40:20.710
Feiyan.

725
40:23.780 --> 40:24.450
Watch out!

726
40:27.660 --> 40:28.500
Second Master,

727
40:28.500 --> 40:29.620
look closely, it's me!

728
40:29.620 --> 40:31.020
You little brat,

729
40:31.270 --> 40:32.380
you screw me over every single time.

730
40:32.380 --> 40:34.340
You're exactly the one I want to chop!

731
40:34.340 --> 40:36.470
Second Master, put the knife down now!

732
40:39.100 --> 40:40.290
If you really kill him,

733
40:40.290 --> 40:41.430
how will you explain it to the Sect Master?

734
40:41.430 --> 40:42.510
It's fine!

735
40:42.540 --> 40:43.620
I'll kill him

736
40:43.620 --> 40:45.790
and then let the Sect Master kill me.

737
40:47.060 --> 40:47.920
Second Master,

738
40:48.200 --> 40:49.390
think carefully.

739
40:49.460 --> 40:51.270
Who benefits most if this scam falls apart?

740
40:51.270 --> 40:53.140
Second Master, neither of us wants to ruin this scam.

741
40:53.140 --> 40:54.660
If no one had found out about the vat,

742
40:54.660 --> 40:55.580
you'd have made the money,

743
40:55.580 --> 40:56.540
I'd have saved that girl and left,

744
40:56.540 --> 40:57.790
and we'd have stayed out of each other's way.

745
40:57.790 --> 40:58.390
Think about it.

746
40:58.390 --> 41:00.140
Why is it that right after we took Li Ling away,

747
41:00.140 --> 41:02.200
Zhang Yinhua discovered our secret?

748
41:02.740 --> 41:05.340
It's obvious someone is trying to set you up.

749
41:05.360 --> 41:06.220
Second Master,

750
41:06.730 --> 41:08.460
you're being used as someone's pawn!

751
41:08.460 --> 41:10.350
Someone has been watching us in this scam the whole time,

752
41:10.350 --> 41:12.070
afraid that you might pull it off perfectly.

753
41:12.070 --> 41:13.540
The closer you get to the Sect Master,

754
41:13.540 --> 41:15.800
whose position do you threaten the most?

755
41:25.050 --> 41:25.750
Sixth Master,

756
41:25.750 --> 41:27.280
looks like it's about time.

757
41:39.820 --> 41:40.820
Sixth Master,

758
41:42.220 --> 41:44.550
you've been watching the show at the door.

759
41:47.450 --> 41:48.620
You must be tired.

760
41:51.130 --> 41:53.310
[In the next episode]

761
41:53.350 --> 41:54.270
You're here.

762
41:54.270 --> 41:54.830
Master,

763
41:54.860 --> 41:55.700
I was wrong.

764
41:56.020 --> 41:57.170
I shouldn't have saved Li Ling.

765
41:57.170 --> 42:00.030
Looks like she wasn't the only one you saved, right?

766
42:02.540 --> 42:04.460
Shatter their souls,

767
42:04.480 --> 42:06.320
and you can return to the world of the living.

768
42:06.320 --> 42:07.550
I'm your stepmom,

769
42:07.570 --> 42:08.860
Xijiao.

770
42:09.660 --> 42:11.270
All of you, die!

771
42:11.540 --> 42:12.620
No!

772
42:15.980 --> 42:18.150
Didn't we agree not to kill?

773
42:18.320 --> 42:19.800
To make money,

774
42:20.790 --> 42:22.020
blood must be shed.
